---
/** A grid of word cards (`Term.astro`) in a lesson: two columns, one on a narrow screen. */
---

<div class="vv-terms not-content"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .vv-terms {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-block: 1rem 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .vv-terms {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
